+| 7 | `rec 10-torque-high-d2 70` | Still HIGH. Deck 2: 3 s Play; 15 s pitch fader to the **bottom**, leave it 10 s, back to the centre by 30 s; 35 s hold the **platter edge** (not the record) for 5 s, release at 40 s; 60 s Play (stops). Then flip the torque switch back to **LOW**. | HIGH on deck 2, deck 2's sag at the fader's bottom, the platter edge held with the motor on | 1.5 |
