+  and digital control (the platter) are Michael's to tune, so they are config, not code. At least
+  `TAKEOVER_TOL` (±3 %), `HANDBACK_TOL` (±1 %), `TAKEOVER_MS`, `SETTLE_MS`, `HELD_RATIO`, `HELD_EXIT_RATIO`,
+  `STALL_MS`, `STOP_MS`, `SPINUP_MS`, `HELD_START_MS` and `BACKSPIN_RATIO` are user-tunable overrides of
