+  with a test named for D25). `STALL_MS` is read by the estimator and the state machine, so the one config object
+  keeps them in agreement (M4-08 review #4). A pair that breaks its hysteresis (`HANDBACK_TOL` above
+  `TAKEOVER_TOL`, `HELD_EXIT_RATIO` at or below `HELD_RATIO`, `BACKSPIN_RATIO` at or above `BACKSPIN_EXIT_RATIO`)
