+  start s, messages, net ticks, min/mean/max ratio, timed share, saturation markers. `--markers` lists each
+  marker with the host gap to its neighbours (check 2). `--fader` adds the deck's last 14-bit pitch fader value
+  (CC 9 MSB, CC 41 LSB on that deck's channel; the order checked on take 23 first) per window. Library in
+  `tools/lib/platter-windows.mjs`, tests on synthetic captures (`tools/synth-platter`).
+  *As built (M5-05):* `--deck`, `--window-ms`, `--from`, `--to`, `--cross <ratio>,…` (the first estimator update
+  past each threshold after `--from`, rising or falling: spin-up, spin-down and backspin times) and `--json`. Each
+  window also has the host-time ratio, the device-timed ratio and the per-message range. `--markers` stayed in
+  `tools/analyze-platter` (M5-04); `--fader` is left to M5-06.
