 // Runs capture-format records (a real capture or tools/synth-platter output) through the whole pure platter core
 // the way the glue will: every message is fed to the decoder with its t_us, every HEARTBEAT_US of t_us a heartbeat
 // is pushed after flush() (unless a CC is still waiting for its pitch bend), and every estimator result goes to the
